<h2 class="single-post-title product_title entry-title" itemprop="name">CX Series: 5′ 3″ to 7′ 6″</h2>
<div class="woocommerce-product-details__short-description">
	<p class="uk-margin uk-text-center uk-h3 uk-heading-line animate-elem slide-left in-view" aria-level="3">Some of the most timeless hits have been recorded on a Yamaha C Series piano. Now this legendary piano has been refined with many of the innovations from our flagship CF. The back posts, soundboard, ribs, strings and hammers have been redesigned for a more delicate attack, rich harmonics, infinite colors and a beautiful resonance capable of long sustained pianissimo tones and nuanced, expressive fortissimo. In the process of refining a legend, the CX has redefined what a grand piano could be.</p>
<p aria-level="3"><b><i>*This product can be purchased in store only.  Call to make an appointment for in store demonstration of this amazing instrument.</i></b>*</p>
</div>
<p class="price"></p>

